# Netlify and Cloudflare Pages SPA fallback.
#
# /account, /deposit, /transfer, /swap and /evidence are client-side routes in a
# single bundle, not files on disk. Without this rule a hard refresh or a shared
# link to any of them returns 404. Existing files (assets, media) still win over
# this rule, so it only catches the app's own paths.
#
# If the backend API is proxied through this same host, put its rule ABOVE this
# line, otherwise the catch-all will answer /api/* with index.html:
#   /api/*  https://api.example.org/api/:splat  200
/*  /index.html  200
